OL,3,GNEWSABeach attacker sentenced to 10
OL,4,Ayears after teen loses leg in stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man whose unprovoked knife attack on
OL,7,Fa 17-year-old boy caused the victim to
OL,8,Flose his leg has been sentenced to 10
OL,9,Fand a half years.
OL,11,FIdris Ahmed, 19, from Riverside in
OL,12,FCardiff, attacked the teenager on Barry
OL,13,FIsland on Bank holiday Monday, on 25
OL,14,FMay. He previously denied grievous
OL,15,Fbodily harm with intent, and possessing
OL,16,Fa knife, but changed his plea to guilty
OL,17,Fduring the trial.
OL,19,FThe victim, who cannot be named because
OL,20,Fof a court order relating to his age,
OL,21,Fhad to have his leg amputated below the
OL,22,Fknee after the wound became infected.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
